  "description": "Normal-convention fixture (P0-NORMAL): the plane-dome low/high pair, Normal mesh map baked by Painter at 512 px with the OpenGL normal map format and tangent space the project default (not set), other baking parameters at their defaults; the baked map exported at 16 bits; recorded twice (same session; after save and reopen).",
  "inputs": [
    {
